{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42757","headline":"送从弟舍人入蜀 · 刘兼","name":"送从弟舍人入蜀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉陵江畔饯行车，离袂难分十里余。\n慷慨莫夸心似铁，留连不觉泪成珠。\n风光川谷梅将发，音信云天雁未疎。\n立马举鞭无限意，会稀别远拟何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42757.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42757","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}